          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Wubineno can, wun lupwony-cik ki Luparicayo, wun lugoba! Pien wulwoko ŋe kikopo ki caani ki woko wek obed leŋ, ento ki igi noŋo gupoŋ ki tim me yako dano ki miti mogo ma pe twero jukke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wun Luparicayo ma lutowaŋ! Mukwoŋo myero koŋ wulwok i kikopo ki i caani obed leŋ, ka wek ŋeye bene obed leŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
